BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 555.00 Tm (People who use sign language may meet someone who does not understand their signs. SAHAYAK) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.1 Tf 0.12 0.16 0.22 rg 1 0 0 1 42 541.90 Tm (explores whether a computer can recognize some trained signs and show their labels. Indian) Tj ET
